          <div class="pt-3 text-sm text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400 leading-relaxed">
            Google stores edits, album descriptions, and updated capture timestamps in their cloud database. Rather than modifying and re-encoding every media file on their servers before zipping, Google dumps the database records into companion <code class="font-mono bg-zinc-100 dark:bg-zinc-800 px-1 py-0.5 rounded">.json</code> sidecar files.
          </div>
